
sloop>  # [inject] 场景 store 开始
# [inject] ⓪ 归一：esptool 硬复位到工厂态（不带上一轮载入的预置参数）
# [inject] 复位设备（esptool flash_id --after hard_reset，不写 flash）

sloop>  I (4365) sloop_display: 触摸反馈 OFF（准星 + 坐标日志）

sloop>  ENG AUDIO ON
ENG AUDIO streaming=1 xrun=0 OK
sloop>  STATE SNAP
STATE SNAP page=0 focus_track=0 focus_step=0 layer_held=0x00 selected_track=0 last_note=0 bpm=90 playing=0 window_bank=0 window_start=0 window_len=16
STATE SNAP trk k=0 mute=0 solo=0
STATE SNAP trk k=1 mute=0 solo=0
STATE SNAP trk k=2 mute=0 solo=0
STATE SNAP trk k=3 mute=0 solo=0
STATE SNAP param trk=0 level=104 atk=10 dec=70 sus=90 rel=60 slen=16 mute=0
STATE SNAP global bpm=90 swing=0
sloop>  STORE STATS
STORE STATS ready=1 base=0x97000 span=0x68000 map=0x40170000 objects=1 faults=0 armed=0
sloop>  # [inject] ⑩ 换引擎/预置 = 换声音：ENG PRESET 期望向量 vs ENG TRACK 应用后的 p[]
ENG TRACK 0 0 0
ENG TRACK k=0 engine=0 preset=0 OK
sloop>  PARAM 0 90
PARAM track=0 id=0 value=90 applied=90 min=0 max=127
sloop>  PARAM 29 12
PARAM track=0 id=29 value=12 applied=12 min=1 max=64
sloop>  # [inject] ⑩a ENG PRESET 0 2 1（期望向量）→ ENG TRACK 0 2 1（应用）→ 71/71
ENG PRESET 0 2 1
用法: ENG INFO|SNAP|STEP <track=0..2> <idx=0..63>|SMOKE|SELFTEST [case]|TRACK <k> <engine> <preset>|TRIG <synth|drum> <a> <b>|DESC <track|global|engine> <engine> <id>|PERF|MEM|AUDIO [ON|OFF]
Command returned non-zero error code: 0x1 (ERROR)
sloop>  # [inject] 场景 store 异常终止: ENG PRESET 0 2 1: 回显 0/71 项（'ENG PRESET 0 2 1\r\n用法: ENG INFO|SNAP|STEP <track=0..2> <idx=0..63>|SMOKE|SELFTEST [case]|TRACK <k> <engine> <preset>|TRIG <synth|drum> <a> <b>|DESC <track|global|engine> <engine> <id>|PERF|MEM|AUDIO [ON|OFF]\r\nCommand returned non-zero error code: 0x1 (ERROR)\r\nsloop>  '）
